{
  "title": "AI Brain - Interactive (交互式调用查看)",
  "description": "查看所有 AI Brain 调用和完整 JSON",
  "tags": ["ai", "brain", "interactive"],
  "timezone": "America/New_York",
  "editable": true,
  "uid": "ai-brain-interactive",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-30d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "📋 所有 AI Brain 调用 (点击展开查看详情)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0}
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "调用列表 - 点击任意行展开下方查看完整 JSON",
      "datasource": {"type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource", "uid": "ch"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 15, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 1},
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource", "uid": "ch"},
        "queryType": "sql",
        "rawSql": "SELECT\n    formatDateTime(ts_ny, '%Y-%m-%d %H:%i:%S') as time,\n    kind,\n    session,\n    provider,\n    model,\n    duration_ms,\n    if(success = 1, '✅', '❌') as status,\n    length(output_json) as json_size,\n    substring(output_json, 1, 100) as preview\nFROM llm.ai_brain_calls\nORDER BY ts_ny DESC\nLIMIT 200",
        "format": 1,
        "refId": "A"
      }],
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "sortBy": [{"displayName": "time", "desc": true}],
        "footer": {"show": true}
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"custom": {"align": "auto"}},
        "overrides": [
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "time"}, "properties": [{"id": "custom.width", "value": 180}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "kind"}, "properties": [{"id": "custom.width", "value": 120}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "session"}, "properties": [{"id": "custom.width", "value": 100}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "duration_ms"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "ms"}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "json_size"}, "properties": [{"id": "unit", "value": "bytes"}]},
          {"matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "preview"}, "properties": [{"id": "custom.width", "value": 400}]}
        ]
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": {},
            "indexByName": {
              "time": 0,
              "kind": 1,
              "session": 2,
              "provider": 3,
              "model": 4,
              "duration_ms": 5,
              "status": 6,
              "json_size": 7,
              "preview": 8
            },
            "renameByName": {}
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "🔍 完整 JSON 查看器 (在上方表格输入时间来查看)",
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": {"h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 16}
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "使用说明",
      "gridPos": {"h": 4, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 17},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## 📖 如何查看完整 JSON\n\n**方法 1**: 在下面的输入框输入时间 (格式: `2025-11-01 14:49:00`),然后点击右侧的查询按钮\n\n**方法 2**: 从上方表格复制时间,粘贴到下面的输入框\n\n**示例时间**: `2025-11-01 14:49:00` 或 `2025-10-31 23:58:29`"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "输入要查看的时间",
      "gridPos": {"h": 3, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 21},
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### 请在 Panel 13 的查询中修改时间\n\n1. 点击下方 \"完整 JSON\" Panel 的标题\n2. 点击 \"Edit\"\n3. 修改 SQL 中的时间: `WHERE formatDateTime(ts_ny, '%Y-%m-%d %H:%i:%S') = '2025-11-01 14:49:00'`\n4. 点击 \"Run query\""
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "🤖 完整 JSON (修改下面查询中的时间来查看不同调用)",
      "datasource": {"type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource", "uid": "ch"},
      "gridPos": {"h": 25, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24},
      "targets": [{
        "datasource": {"type": "grafana-clickhouse-datasource", "uid": "ch"},
        "queryType": "sql",
        "rawSql": "SELECT\n    formatDateTime(ts_ny, '%Y-%m-%d %H:%i:%S') as time,\n    kind,\n    provider,\n    model,\n    output_json\nFROM llm.ai_brain_calls\nWHERE formatDateTime(ts_ny, '%Y-%m-%d %H:%i:%S') = '2025-11-01 14:49:00'\nLIMIT 1",
        "format": 1,
        "refId": "A"
      }],
      "options": {"showHeader": true},
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {"custom": {"align": "left"}},
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {"id": "byName", "options": "output_json"},
            "properties": [{"id": "custom.displayMode", "value": "json-view"}]
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
